vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">李飞飞团队发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，推动 AI 从被动感知转向主动交互</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动联合港科大发布MMProLong模型，优化长文档LMM训练效率</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波LingBot-VA论文被RSS2026接收，实现机器人边推演边行动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dabf9667e4b53edfd4551849456dda7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁灵波科技与香港科技大学合作的论文《Causal World Modeling for Robot Control》近日被机器人顶级学术会议RSS 2026接收。该研究提出面向机器人控制的因果世界建模框架，并开源了全球首个自回归视频-动作世界模型LingBot-VA。LingBot-VA采用Mixture-of-Transformers（MoT）架构，将视频预测与动作生成统一在自回归扩散框架中，赋予机器人“边观察、边判断、边行动”的因果推演能力。在技术实现上，模型通过闭环推演机制减少误差累积，并具备强长期记忆能力。性能方面，在RoboTwin 2.0基准测试中，LingBot-VA在Easy和Hard设置下分别取得92.0%和91.1%的成功率；在真实世界评测中，仅需50条示范数据即可适配，成功率较业界基线π</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯ima宣布全面开放Copilot智能体并上线知识技能分享平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/83c98052c772028ca96b711420209181.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能知识管理平台ima今日宣布，其AI智能体产品“Copilot”正式取消排队机制，实现全面开放。ima Copilot定位为“知识Agent”，具备持续进化的记忆与全场景感知能力，支持用户调用个人知识库、接入外部模型API及扩展自定义Skill。该产品可通过自然语言指令自动执行网页浏览、全网调研及可视化报告生成等复杂任务，显著提升工作流自动化水平。同步推出的“知识号”功能支持用户将复用性工作流程封装为Skill，并发布至“知识广场”进行分享与流转。首批上线了包括“微信读书”、“腾讯招聘”在内的官方Skill。此次更新标志着ima从单一知识管理工具向集“知识沉淀、智能调用、能力共享”于一体的“知识+Agent”平台演进。用户更新至最新版本即可体验完整功能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">李飞飞团队发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，推动 AI 从被动感知转向主动交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/78e095b7b0fa4ca1f2f5e8f5c0cbb581.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">李飞飞团队近日发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，旨在解决 AI 在物理空间交互中的短板。该基准基于认知心理学核心知识系统，构建于 OmniGibson 仿真平台，包含 10 个类别、29 个子类别及 3081 个任务实例。ESI-Bench 强制要求模型建立“感知-行动回路”，即模型必须主动决定导航、观察及操作以获取空间信息，而非依赖被动视角。针对 GPT-5、Gemini 等前沿多模态模型的测试揭示了三大核心问题：一是模型缺乏主动导航与操纵策略，导致“动作盲视”；二是实时 3D 重建产生的几何伪影会产生“有毒数据”，效果劣于 2D 图片；三是模型存在“元认知缺陷”，即缺乏怀疑机制，在信息匮乏时仍会产生高置信度幻觉。该基准的发布标志着具身智能评测从静态图文匹配向真实物理交互范式转移，强调了序列决策能力与元认</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动联合港科大发布MMProLong模型，优化长文档LMM训练效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/322294f33be68d3d0c10e184cd8905a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动Seed团队联合香港科技大学发布多模态大语言模型（LMM）研究成果MMProLong。该模型基于Qwen2.5-VL构建，核心突破在于证明了针对特定目标的问答对（QA）训练在长文档处理中显著优于传统的OCR转录。研究发现，纯文本转录会导致模型长上下文定位能力下降，而使用Seed2.0生成的长上下文QA对训练，能有效引导模型在冗长信息中精准检索。在仅128,000个Token的训练预算下，MMProLong在256,000至512,000个Token长度下表现稳定，并在MMLongBench与MM-NIAH基准测试中超越InternVL3-38B及Gemma3-27B。该策略已在Qwen3-VL-8B上验证有效，并成功迁移至长视频理解任务。此项研究为行业提供了一条无需改动底层架构、通过优化数据组织形式提升</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f5eade8585a31c487191397abb5a32ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 25, 202612根据 OpenRouter 刚刚发布的最新监测数据，全球大模型调用市场正在经历一场“向东看”的剧烈范式转移。上周（5 月 18 日至 5 月 24 日），全球 AI 大模型总调用量攀升至 28.9 万亿 Token，环比增长 7.4%，展现出连续五周不间断的强劲增长势头。在这场算力与应用的全球博弈中，中国大模型不仅在规模上实现了对美国的持续领跑，其增长速度更展现出惊人的爆发力。全球总盘： 全球周调用量高达 28.9 万亿 Token，连续 5 周上涨，AI 基础设施进入高频常态化调用阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
